WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.060
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.000 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.340 --> 01:24.070
...is often called this...

01:24.140 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:38.360 --> 01:39.520
Thank you!

01:40.290 --> 01:41.350
Lucky!

01:41.730 --> 01:44.130
Isn't it kind of dangerous in
the middle of the night like this?

01:44.200 --> 01:45.960
What are you saying, old man?

01:46.470 --> 01:47.260
Hey...

01:47.570 --> 01:50.160
Can I still have that juice?

01:50.600 --> 01:51.800
Yeah! Here!

01:52.240 --> 01:53.040
Thank you!

01:54.680 --> 01:55.400
Wait!

01:55.480 --> 01:56.200
What!

01:56.280 --> 01:57.440
S-Stop!

02:21.100 --> 02:22.160
Get it together!

02:23.200 --> 02:24.230
Why...

02:24.340 --> 02:27.140
Why would you do
such a horrible thing?

02:27.310 --> 02:28.140
Naoya!

02:37.550 --> 02:38.350
Jiro!

02:38.650 --> 02:39.810
Wake up, Jiro!

02:41.390 --> 02:42.250
Wh-What?

02:46.990 --> 02:48.620
Reiko, what's wrong?

02:48.860 --> 02:50.560
They are watching us the whole time.

02:50.660 --> 02:51.430
What?

02:53.400 --> 02:54.830
Damn it!

02:58.270 --> 03:01.240
You people won't take me down.

03:02.040 --> 03:03.070
Reiko?

03:08.380 --> 03:09.910
Damn it!

03:21.760 --> 03:22.750
Where!

03:22.830 --> 03:23.820
Where did you go!

03:24.630 --> 03:25.720
Reiko...

03:32.970 --> 03:33.800
There it is.

03:34.470 --> 03:36.410
Reiko, stop it.

03:36.740 --> 03:38.570
I beg you. Stop, Reiko!

03:38.850 --> 03:40.340
But over there!

03:45.190 --> 03:47.240
I won't lose!

03:47.420 --> 03:48.850
Reiko, calm down.

03:49.720 --> 03:50.710
Come on...

03:51.060 --> 03:52.250
Let's go to bed.

03:54.700 --> 03:55.920
Reiko?

03:56.000 --> 03:58.230
<i>Missing high school
girl found dead.</i>

03:58.300 --> 03:59.360
Purple clothing.

04:01.000 --> 04:06.200
That woman thinks that people wearing
purple clothing are all her enemies.

04:07.510 --> 04:09.840
She's being thrown
around by obsession.

04:09.910 --> 04:16.370
There is a definite reason for the
negative powers being drawn to you.

04:17.650 --> 04:21.250
If you don't run from it,
you can find the answer.

04:22.520 --> 04:26.250
If you don't run from it,
you can find the answer.

04:27.790 --> 04:29.060
<i>Trace</i>

04:29.060 --> 04:32.860
<i>Trace
Episode 4</i>

04:36.800 --> 04:38.200
Help me.

04:42.440 --> 04:43.700
Brother...

04:46.910 --> 04:48.040
Help me...

04:48.620 --> 04:50.850
Help me, Brother!

04:55.760 --> 04:56.650
Wait!

04:57.190 --> 04:57.990
What?

04:59.360 --> 05:00.760
Put her back in the suitcase.

05:01.260 --> 05:01.920
Huh?

05:02.730 --> 05:04.200
B-But...

05:04.560 --> 05:06.190
Hurry up, stupid!

05:06.770 --> 05:07.860
Y-Yes!

05:09.440 --> 05:11.300
Hurry up! We're going to the rooftop.

05:11.610 --> 05:12.370
Rooftop?

05:12.440 --> 05:13.670
Hurry it up!

05:14.240 --> 05:15.070
Yes!

05:20.380 --> 05:21.640
Hurry up, Jiro!

05:21.750 --> 05:23.680
W-Wait, Reiko!

05:38.030 --> 05:39.620
Reiko, you can't.

05:43.370 --> 05:44.770
It should be locked.

06:06.460 --> 06:07.320
Someone!

06:07.730 --> 06:09.030
Someone come!

06:09.360 --> 06:10.630
Help!

06:13.230 --> 06:14.330
Help me!

06:14.530 --> 06:15.590
Please!

06:31.520 --> 06:33.780
Reiko, what are you going to do?

06:35.390 --> 06:36.690
We are going over there.

06:36.760 --> 06:37.550
What?

06:37.920 --> 06:40.450
I'm going to tell those guys...

06:41.530 --> 06:43.290
...that this one messed up!

07:04.480 --> 07:05.950
R-Reiko?

07:06.220 --> 07:08.190
Hurry up and tie this one with the rope!

07:08.460 --> 07:10.320
We're going to hang her from up there!

07:17.730 --> 07:19.060
Jiro, hurry!

07:31.080 --> 07:32.840
This isn't the past.

07:35.950 --> 07:37.110
Who are you?

07:50.230 --> 07:50.890
Come on!

07:51.330 --> 07:52.760
Watch this carefully!

07:52.930 --> 07:56.530
Your plan ends as a failure!

08:05.680 --> 08:07.650
This isn't the past.

08:09.880 --> 08:11.980
You should know this already.

08:13.820 --> 08:15.050
This isn't...

08:15.320 --> 08:16.290
...the past.

08:19.560 --> 08:22.460
This isn't the past.

08:25.230 --> 08:28.720
It was something that's
going to happen from now.

08:31.910 --> 08:32.840
Naoya?

08:33.670 --> 08:34.830
Brother...

08:36.680 --> 08:39.700
What I have been
seeing wasn't the past.

08:40.410 --> 08:42.310
It's what's going to happen from now.

08:45.090 --> 08:47.250
It's what's going to happen tonight.

08:47.790 --> 08:48.620
What did you say?

08:48.920 --> 08:51.620
That woman hasn't been killed yet.

08:51.730 --> 08:53.590
She's asking us...

08:54.860 --> 08:56.060
...to save her!

09:05.270 --> 09:06.260
Is this too flashy?

09:25.760 --> 09:27.160
Yes, hello?

09:28.460 --> 09:29.330
Yeah.

09:30.030 --> 09:33.190
What? You rented
a flashy car like that?

09:33.670 --> 09:36.000
Really? I'm really looking forward to it!

09:36.200 --> 09:36.960
Yeah.

09:37.140 --> 09:38.160
Yeah, I got it!

09:38.240 --> 09:39.640
Later then!

09:43.280 --> 09:47.010
From the position of the Tokyo Tower
and the position of the moon you saw...

09:47.080 --> 09:49.410
...we will figure out where the hotel is.

09:51.050 --> 09:53.880
If you get close to it, you should feel it.

09:54.050 --> 09:56.750
We need to stop this
last murder somehow!

10:04.760 --> 10:05.560
Naoya!

10:07.000 --> 10:08.130
Brother! Again!

10:08.600 --> 10:10.090
Don't look away, Naoya!

10:10.170 --> 10:11.160
You have to withstand it!

10:11.740 --> 10:14.210
If you run, that woman
is going to be killed!

10:14.270 --> 10:17.070
Your suffering is going
to continue forever too!

10:17.880 --> 10:19.280
Brother...

10:20.080 --> 10:22.550
You should know this already.

10:23.520 --> 10:24.640
Help me...

10:25.390 --> 10:26.550
Brother...

10:29.920 --> 10:31.120
I will save you.

10:31.490 --> 10:33.860
I will save you, Naoya!

10:51.910 --> 10:52.880
There!

10:53.550 --> 10:54.270
What?

10:54.350 --> 10:55.510
There's still another one!

10:55.650 --> 10:56.640
That one.

10:58.390 --> 10:59.180
That girl!

10:59.790 --> 11:01.580
R-Reiko...

11:02.290 --> 11:03.260
That girl?

11:03.320 --> 11:04.810
Yeah, that one!

11:05.330 --> 11:07.490
She's after me again.

11:07.690 --> 11:08.460
Damn it!

11:08.900 --> 11:10.230
But hey, Reiko...

11:10.330 --> 11:11.730
Maybe it's...

11:11.800 --> 11:13.630
...a mistake.

11:14.430 --> 11:15.330
Idiot!

11:15.400 --> 11:16.530
I-It hurts!

11:16.840 --> 11:20.240
That woman is the last assassin!
If I defeat her...

11:20.640 --> 11:23.670
B-But Reiko, you said
that the other day too...

11:24.010 --> 11:25.000
Idiot!

11:25.380 --> 11:28.810
You just stay quiet and
listen to what I tell you to do!

11:53.870 --> 11:56.000
R-Reiko, wait up.

12:03.450 --> 12:04.920
It's most likely this way.

12:05.290 --> 12:06.650
Don't worry.

12:07.250 --> 12:08.350
We'll find it right away.

12:09.590 --> 12:10.520
Yeah.

12:12.160 --> 12:17.720
She was saying to her enemies
that the last assassin failed.

12:19.270 --> 12:22.790
So that everyone can see,
she's going to kill...

12:25.370 --> 12:27.600
That woman's
subconscious awareness...

12:27.670 --> 12:30.140
...picked up the fact that
she will become the victim.

12:30.680 --> 12:33.010
And she came seeking your help.

12:34.150 --> 12:34.840
What's wrong?

12:37.020 --> 12:38.880
Naoya, get it together!

12:42.660 --> 12:43.750
This is bad.

12:45.060 --> 12:46.620
This is bad, Brother.

12:55.440 --> 12:57.200
She's been captured by those two.

12:57.840 --> 12:59.830
She's being stuffed into the suitcase.

13:00.940 --> 13:02.030
What did you say?

13:02.210 --> 13:03.470
Suffering...

13:03.980 --> 13:05.410
She's suffering!

13:10.350 --> 13:11.840
Hurry, Brother!

13:20.930 --> 13:22.260
Hang in there, Naoya.

13:22.660 --> 13:24.150
I will definitely save you.

13:43.280 --> 13:44.380
Painful...

13:45.080 --> 13:46.880
It's painful, Brother.

13:47.190 --> 13:49.590
It's dark, and I can't even breathe.

13:49.820 --> 13:51.260
Get it together, Naoya!

13:51.790 --> 13:52.820
We should be close.

13:53.030 --> 13:54.760
We need to find their hotel!

14:05.140 --> 14:06.110
Hurry!

14:07.240 --> 14:08.210
Yes.

14:27.160 --> 14:27.960
Shut up!

14:29.360 --> 14:30.190
What's wrong?

14:31.160 --> 14:32.560
I was kicked.

14:32.800 --> 14:34.130
Inside the suitcase...

14:34.700 --> 14:35.670
Damn it.

14:36.540 --> 14:38.160
Th-That way...

14:38.500 --> 14:39.770
Go that way.

14:39.840 --> 14:40.640
Okay.

14:54.190 --> 14:55.180
Hurry!

14:55.290 --> 14:56.590
Stop being slow!

14:56.890 --> 14:57.410
Yes.

15:14.670 --> 15:15.640
Hurry!

15:16.110 --> 15:16.910
Yes!

15:28.890 --> 15:29.820
Wait!

15:33.660 --> 15:35.130
Put her back in the suitcase.

15:37.300 --> 15:38.860
B-But...

15:39.000 --> 15:40.490
Hurry up, stupid!

15:40.970 --> 15:41.830
Yes!

15:42.900 --> 15:44.730
Hurry up! We're going to the rooftop.

15:45.140 --> 15:46.130
Rooftop?

15:46.210 --> 15:47.400
Hurry it up!

15:47.840 --> 15:48.600
Yes!

15:54.080 --> 15:55.740
Reiko, you can't.

15:56.120 --> 15:57.810
It should be locked.

16:02.390 --> 16:04.080
They're headed for the rooftop.

16:04.190 --> 16:05.120
Hurry, Brother!

16:12.300 --> 16:14.860
Reiko, what are you going to do?

16:16.500 --> 16:17.400
We're going over there.

16:48.870 --> 16:49.960
Brother, there it is!

16:50.370 --> 16:51.390
It's there!

16:52.010 --> 16:53.600
That! Over there!

16:54.210 --> 16:55.040
Okay.

17:09.520 --> 17:11.990
Come on! Look closely!

17:12.230 --> 17:15.290
Your plan ends as a failure!

17:15.560 --> 17:16.590
Failure!

17:17.000 --> 17:18.160
You get it?

17:18.330 --> 17:20.600
It's a failure!

17:22.770 --> 17:25.260
<i>Higashiyoko City Hotel</i>

17:50.300 --> 17:51.560
Come on, Jiro.

17:53.200 --> 17:53.930
Yes.

17:55.840 --> 17:57.000
Stop!

17:59.210 --> 17:59.970
Who's there!

18:00.140 --> 18:01.070
Stop!

18:01.140 --> 18:02.130
Stop right there!

18:02.210 --> 18:03.200
You guys!

18:03.280 --> 18:04.770
That woman has done nothing!

18:05.240 --> 18:07.140
You have to stop killing people now!

18:09.350 --> 18:10.340
Really?

18:10.780 --> 18:12.220
So it was you guys.

18:16.220 --> 18:17.850
It's too late now!

18:18.060 --> 18:20.180
Your plan was a failure!

18:21.690 --> 18:23.130
Brother...

18:26.200 --> 18:28.190
Come on. Do it, Jiro.

18:29.400 --> 18:31.370
R-Reiko...

18:31.800 --> 18:32.440
Let's not...

18:32.440 --> 18:33.740
Let's not...
Hurry up and do it!

18:36.010 --> 18:36.980
Damn it!

18:37.540 --> 18:38.130
Brother!

19:35.870 --> 19:37.670
Why do you target me!

19:38.240 --> 19:39.830
Even if I defeat them over and over...

19:39.910 --> 19:43.500
...why do you keep on
targeting me over and over?

19:43.810 --> 19:44.870
Reiko...

19:47.950 --> 19:50.780
You guys aren't with those guys?

19:51.420 --> 19:52.440
Those guys?

20:01.460 --> 20:02.150
Reiko!

20:03.660 --> 20:04.360
Brother!

20:23.880 --> 20:26.320
Reiko!

20:45.870 --> 20:46.960
Reiko was...

20:47.570 --> 20:49.510
Reiko was running from them.

20:50.380 --> 20:52.110
She was actually being chased after.

20:52.680 --> 20:54.840
Reiko was running from them!

20:56.420 --> 20:58.380
What was she running from?

20:59.150 --> 21:00.050
I don't know.

21:01.250 --> 21:02.050
But...

21:02.760 --> 21:04.280
Reiko was saying...

21:06.660 --> 21:08.920
...Ark was chasing after her.

21:09.800 --> 21:10.760
Ark?

21:11.260 --> 21:12.460
Brother!

21:13.000 --> 21:15.090
This woman was saved!

21:15.740 --> 21:17.700
Brother, she was saved!

21:23.240 --> 21:24.400
Is someone there?

21:27.650 --> 21:28.510
Let's go.

21:29.020 --> 21:29.850
Yeah.

21:36.320 --> 21:38.760
What are you doing in a place like this?

21:44.000 --> 21:44.960
Reiko...

21:57.240 --> 21:58.510
I'm glad.

21:59.050 --> 22:01.610
She was saved.

22:02.950 --> 22:03.780
Yeah.

22:05.250 --> 22:06.550
We saved her.

22:11.920 --> 22:13.360
What is Ark?

22:29.910 --> 22:38.720
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

22:38.780 --> 22:47.560
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

22:47.630 --> 22:56.400
<i>A single shadow looked like light
in this world that I'm imprisoned in.</i>

22:56.470 --> 23:05.210
<i>The rain of May became lighter
as it was kindly shining tomorrow.</i>

23:05.280 --> 23:09.610
<i>I lost the meaning of smiling...</i>

23:09.680 --> 23:13.980
<i>... that day I thought I
lost my place to be.</i>

23:14.050 --> 23:18.420
<i>I wished for your warmth.</i>

23:18.490 --> 23:22.930
<i>We have stopped time.</i>

23:23.160 --> 23:27.260
<i>I had this feeling it was
eventually going to come, but...</i>

23:27.330 --> 23:31.900
<i>... I pretended I didn't know
and buried my loneliness.</i>

23:31.970 --> 23:42.070
<i>I looked down at your feet as the
droplets describing "Good-bye" fell.</i>

23:42.720 --> 23:51.450
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

23:51.520 --> 23:59.900
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

24:01.330 --> 24:02.990
Our house that I've seen
even in my dreams...

24:03.340 --> 24:06.960
That house was the starting
point of our abominable fate.

24:07.440 --> 24:10.530
The difference that
arises in our memories...

24:10.710 --> 24:15.740
Is that an alteration of unconsciousness
or is it a bad tasting fabrication?

24:16.420 --> 24:19.780
When the known anxiety
turns into clear discouragement...

24:19.850 --> 24:23.450
...the situation outside of
assumption stops our feet.

24:24.190 --> 24:29.860
<i>Episode 5, "Reminiscence."</i>

24:26.630 --> 24:29.860
Where are we headed?
